    {
      "id": "editable-cards",
      "title": "Cards, rules, and text stay independently editable",
      "kind": "content",
      "speaker_notes": "Select any card, rule, heading, or paragraph in PowerPoint to verify independent editing.",
      "sources": ["EvoFlux editable-first pipeline verification"],
      "html": "<div class=\"safe\"><p class=\"kicker\">Editable-first / 01</p><h1 class=\"title\" data-pptx-role=\"title\">Cards, rules, and text stay independently editable</h1><div class=\"rule\" data-pptx-native=\"line\" style=\"position:absolute;left:0;right:0;top:235px;height:4px;background:#2f6fed\"></div><article class=\"editable-card card-one\" data-box data-pptx-shape=\"roundRect\"><span class=\"label\" data-pptx-native=\"text\">01 / Text</span><h2>Rewrite the claim</h2><p>Headings and body copy are native text boxes by default.</p></article><article class=\"editable-card card-two\" data-box data-pptx-shape=\"roundRect\"><span class=\"label\" data-pptx-native=\"text\">02 / Shape</span><h2>Restyle the card</h2><p>Solid fill, border, and rounded geometry become a native shape.</p></article><article class=\"editable-card card-three\" data-box data-pptx-shape=\"roundRect\"><span class=\"label\" data-pptx-native=\"text\">03 / Layout</span><h2>Move every object</h2><p>Each promoted element can be selected and repositioned separately.</p></article></div>"
    },
    {
      "id": "editable-image",
      "title": "Images and SVG art become movable picture objects",
      "kind": "content",
      "speaker_notes": "The SVG diagram is captured exactly and inserted as its own movable picture object. The gradient glow intentionally stays raster.",
      "sources": ["EvoFlux editable-first pipeline verification"],
      "html": "<div class=\"raster-glow\" data-pptx-raster data-qa-ignore></div><div class=\"safe\" style=\"width:720px;right:auto\"><p class=\"kicker\">Editable-first / 02</p><h1 class=\"title\" data-pptx-role=\"title\">Images and SVG art become movable picture objects</h1><p class=\"subtitle\">The complex visual remains exact, but it is no longer welded to the full-slide background.</p><div data-box data-pptx-shape=\"roundRect\" style=\"margin-top:55px;width:620px;padding:26px 30px;border:2px solid #cbd8e8;border-radius:16px;background:#fff\"><p style=\"margin:0;font-size:23px\">Use <strong>data-pptx-raster</strong> only for gradients, clipping, filters, transforms, and decorative compounds.</p></div></div><svg class=\"native-art\" data-pptx-native=\"image\" viewBox=\"0 0 510 360\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><rect x=\"25\" y=\"125\" width=\"130\" height=\"96\" rx=\"18\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"#2f6fed\" stroke-width=\"4\"/><rect x=\"190\" y=\"52\" width=\"130\" height=\"96\" rx=\"18\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"#2f6fed\" stroke-width=\"4\"/><rect x=\"355\" y=\"125\" width=\"130\" height=\"96\" rx=\"18\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"#2f6fed\" stroke-width=\"4\"/><path d=\"M155 173 L190 100 M320 100 L355 173\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#e97335\" stroke-width=\"6\"/><text x=\"90\" y=\"182\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"Arial\" font-size=\"23\" fill=\"#17242d\">Input</text><text x=\"255\" y=\"109\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"Arial\" font-size=\"23\" fill=\"#17242d\">Model</text><text x=\"420\" y=\"182\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"Arial\" font-size=\"23\" fill=\"#17242d\">Output</text></svg>"
    }
